// "discards" — the third-person discard verb phrase ([CR#701.9]; the
// affected player chooses which cards, [CR#701.9b]). A parse/render
// template over the core `Discard` player action for the
// declarative-subject production ("Target player discards a card",
// "Each opponent discards two cards"); expands in place to
// `Discard(count: n)`.
(
    name: "Discards",
    template: "discards ${0:card|cards}",
    kinds: [PlayerAction],
    params: [Count],
    body: Discard(count: Param(0)),
)
